# This repo is PUBLIC (github.com/daman8271/jivo-cli, private:false).
# The code here is safe to share; what goes in and comes out is not — the input
# sheets are JIVO's production plan and the output workbooks carry live stock
# figures per godown. Both stay on the operator's machine.
#
# Keep every pattern on its own line. A trailing "# comment" is NOT a comment
# here — it becomes part of the pattern, and the rule silently matches nothing.

# the operator's RM sheets
in/

# the built workbooks
out/
